  "description": "NINLAZ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H172 N16 O40 Tb8,4(C1 H4 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.733-3.855 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.26-113.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb8(LH2)4(μ-Piv)4(η2-Piv)4(μ-OMe)4]·4CH3OH·4H2O.",
